{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"rencheng-e-5c288406164406097285","title":"孙盛论曹魏封建得失","accounts":[{"id":"rencheng-a-5c288406164406097285","label":"裴注·孙盛评说","text":"孙盛论曹魏封建得失","evidence":["rencheng-q-822d34bcc23ad7a5ff7b"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["rencheng-q-822d34bcc23ad7a5ff7b"]},"ordering_evidence":"rencheng-q-822d34bcc23ad7a5ff7b","order":3819}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"rencheng-q-822d34bcc23ad7a5ff7b","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-8967edcb2dc446a30439","layer":"pei","quote":"孙盛曰：“异哉，魏氏之封建也！不度先王之典，不思藩屏之术；违敦睦之风，背维城之义。汉初之封，或权侔人主；虽云不度，时势然也。魏氏诸侯，陋同匹夫；虽惩七国，矫枉过也！且魏之代汉，非积德之由；风泽既微，六合未一；而雕翦枝干，委权异族；势同瘣木，危若巢幕：不嗣忽诸，非天丧也！五等之制，万世不易之典。六代兴亡，曹冏论之详矣。”","attribution":"裴注·孙盛评说","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":460,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c04763ce3aa8e45f11a0","start":0,"end":160,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
